deadlock-qol-mods: Deadlock Panorama mods by luxus.

Copyright (c) 2026 Kai Löhnert (luxus). MIT (LICENSE), unless a file says otherwise.

Credits
- zipline-boost: the overlay's structure, placement and icon are adapted from the
  Zip Boost overlay in QOLLOCK by civo7 (https://github.com/civo7/QOLLOCK),
  Apache License 2.0. See paks/zipline-boost/NOTICE for the files and the changes.
- lobby-ranks: written from scratch, MIT (paks/lobby-ranks/LICENSE).
- commend: written from scratch against docs/cleanroom-spec/commend.md, MIT (paks/commend/LICENSE).
  Settings strings are Kai's. Button labels on the row are fixed English.
- profile-links: written from scratch against docs/cleanroom-spec/profile-links.md, MIT
  (paks/profile-links/LICENSE). Settings strings are Kai's. The 64x64 logos are the
  Statlocker and DeadChaps site icons, scaled with Lanczos and compiled by tools/vtex.py.
- lib/addon-settings: Addon Settings by luxus, MIT, vendored unchanged from
  https://github.com/luxus/improved-quickbuy.
- Rank badge images come from the deadlock-api.com API
  (https://api.deadlock-api.com), fetched at runtime and not stored here.
- Files under paks/*/vanilla/ are Valve's Deadlock layouts, decompiled from the
  game's pak01_dir.vpk with modlock as the unmodified input for tools/layout.py.
  They belong to Valve. hud.xml.reference is a reference copy and is not shipped.
- Paks are compiled with modlock (https://github.com/paralin/modlock, MIT), v0.1.77.

Third-party services contacted
- api.deadlock-api.com: rank badge images (lobby-ranks).
